  "description": "Persist structured logs to rolling JSON files with zero configuration. One JSON entry routes the exact log levels you care about to file. New in 5.0.7: TryGetValue fast path in multi-tenant DynamicPropertyFileSink — 3-4x faster on steady-state hits, zero delegate allocations. Supports FileNameProperty for per-tenant log separation: different tenants write to different files automatically.",
